383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (             The domain of the SmartCare Management System \(SmartCare\) focuses on home care services specifically designed for elderly individuals, children, or patients requiring domestic assistance. It caters to caretaker companies offering services such as elder care, babysitting, and maid services.              The system functions as a digital platform connecting clients \(elders or families\) with professional caretakers while also streamlining administrative processes for the company. It bridges the communication gap between clients and caretakers, ensuring efficient scheduling, service assignment, and management.)
/E (             The domain of the SmartCare Management System \(SmartCare\) focuses on home care services specifically designed for elderly individuals, children, or patients requiring domestic assistance. It caters to caretaker companies offering services such as elder care, babysitting, and maid services.              The system functions as a digital platform connecting clients \(elders or families\) with professional caretakers while also streamlining administrative processes for the company. It bridges the communication gap between clients and caretakers, ensuring efficient scheduling, service assignment, and management.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
